{"id":"17f62e88bfe3bea2","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination.md","title":"ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination","display":"ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination","aliases":["56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination"],"display":"ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination","depends_on":["[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","[[56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination]]"],"source_section":"6.2.13","source_pages":"193","source_ocr_blocks":[214],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"local-algebraic-calculation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1fcf344733aab173\" href=\"?note=1fcf344733aab173\" title=\"56-df-polynomial-interpretation\">56-df-polynomial-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1137f15ba0af6b3\" href=\"?note=e1137f15ba0af6b3\" title=\"56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination\">56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.13"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"193"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-algebraic-calculation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+,\\cdot\\}\">\\(F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+,\\cdot\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(+)=\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)=2\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(+)=\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)=2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>。多项式输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span> 是项符号，其解释不等于整数 0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{ar}}:=\\{&amp; (+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y))),\\\\\n&amp; (\\cdot(\\mathbf0,x),\\mathbf0),\\;(\\cdot(s(x),y),+(y,\\cdot(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&amp;:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+3,\\\\\nP_+(X,Y)&amp;:=2X+Y,\\qquad P_\\cdot(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{ar}},&gt;_{(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{ar}}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{ar}}:=\\{&amp; (+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y))),\\\\\n&amp; (\\cdot(\\mathbf0,x),\\mathbf0),\\;(\\cdot(s(x),y),+(y,\\cdot(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&amp;:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+3,\\\\\nP_+(X,Y)&amp;:=2X+Y,\\qquad P_\\cdot(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{ar}},&gt;_{(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{ar}}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Example 6.2.13。四条规则的解释左减右依次为 4、3、2X−2、Y；在 X,Y≥2 时均严格正。各运算值域落在 A₂，且对所有参数严格递增。这个解释有意略大于算术本义，以给递归计算留出下降余量；不可把符号 0 的解释误读为整数 0。已重算全部四个差值。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.13，印刷页 193。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination","status":"resolved","id":"e1137f15ba0af6b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+,\\cdot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(+)=\\mathrm{ar}(\\cdot)=2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{ar}}:=\\{& (+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y))),\\\\\n& (\\cdot(\\mathbf0,x),\\mathbf0),\\;(\\cdot(s(x),y),+(y,\\cdot(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+3,\\\\\nP_+(X,Y)&:=2X+Y,\\qquad P_\\cdot(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{ar}},>_{(A_2,I_P,>\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{ar}}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1898,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-arithmetic-polynomial-termination.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1fcf344733aab173","e1137f15ba0af6b3"]}